89
00:10:43.726 --> 00:10:44.727
Halo Pak.

90
00:10:47.063 --> 00:10:49.523
Anda pasti sudah menunggu lama.
Maaf, penerbangan saya tertunda.

91
00:10:49.607 --> 00:10:51.359
